  "description": "After noticing Lee-dam's beauty and potential through a school group project video, Ha Do-cheol—drawn to her editing skills—proposes that she debut as a streamer. In desperate need of money, Lee-dam eventually gives in to the temptation. Starting a double life kept secret from the school, in a world where a single donation can flip a life upside down, Do-cheol sticks by her as her manager and editor, deciding to bet everything on her life.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=855297), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14767055)",
